### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traceforge/v1/health

### Create event (write)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traceforge/v1/events
X-API-Key: dev-write-key
Idempotency-Key: demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspace_id": "public",
  "service": "demo",
  "actor": "user:123",
  "action": "LOGIN",
  "resource": "session:abc",
  "metadata": { "ip": "127.0.0.1" }
}

# Expected: 201 Created
# {
#   "id": "...",
#   "workspace_id": "public",
#   "idempotency_key": "demo-1",
#   "service": "demo",
#   "actor": "user:123",
#   "action": "LOGIN",
#   "resource": "session:abc",
#   "metadata": { "ip": "127.0.0.1" },
#   "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
# }

### Create event (idempotent retry / duplicate)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traceforge/v1/events
X-API-Key: dev-write-key
Idempotency-Key: demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspace_id": "public",
  "service": "demo",
  "actor": "user:123",
  "action": "LOGIN",
  "resource": "session:abc",
  "metadata": { "ip": "127.0.0.1" }
}

# Expected: 200 OK (same event as the first request)
# {
#   "id": "...",
#   "workspace_id": "public",
#   "idempotency_key": "demo-1",
#   "service": "demo",
#   "actor": "user:123",
#   "action": "LOGIN",
#   "resource": "session:abc",
#   "metadata": { "ip": "127.0.0.1" },
#   "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
# }

### List events (public read)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traceforge/v1/events?service=demo
X-Public-Read-Key: dev-public-read-key

# Expected: 200 OK
# [
#   {
#     "id": "...",
#     "workspace_id": "public",
#     "idempotency_key": "demo-1",
#     "service": "demo",
#     "actor": "user:123",
#     "action": "LOGIN",
#     "resource": "session:abc",
#     "metadata": { "ip": "127.0.0.1" },
#     "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
#   }
# ]
